---
import { Clock3, ShieldCheck } from '@lucide/astro';
import WhatsAppCtaLink from './WhatsAppCtaLink.astro';

const reveal =
	'opacity-0 translate-y-4 transition duration-700 ease-out will-change-transform will-change-opacity motion-reduce:transition-none data-[revealed=true]:opacity-100 data-[revealed=true]:translate-y-0';
---

<section
	id="contact"
	class={`bg-(--surface-container-low) py-20 sm:px-10 ${reveal}`}
	data-reveal
	data-revealed="false"
	aria-labelledby="contact-title"
>
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
		<h2 id="contact-title" class="text-3xl text-(--primary) sm:text-5xl">Me contacter</h2>
		<p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-(--secondary)">
			Une question sur RE-FLOW ou envie de vérifier si l’accompagnement te correspond ? Écris-moi simplement sur
			WhatsApp.
		</p>

		<div class="mt-10 rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-black/5 sm:p-8">
			<WhatsAppCtaLink
				campaign="contact"
				showIcon={true}
				class="whatsapp-btn w-full gap-3 rounded-full px-6 py-4 text-base font-semibold sm:w-auto sm:px-10"
			>
				Écrire à Cécile sur WhatsApp
			</WhatsAppCtaLink>

			<p class="mt-5 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-sm text-(--secondary)">
				<Clock3 class="size-4 shrink-0 text-(--primary)" aria-hidden="true" />
				Réponse sous 24 à 48 h ouvrées
			</p>

			<p
				class="mt-6 flex items-start justify-center gap-2 border-t border-black/5 pt-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-(--secondary)"
			>
				<ShieldCheck class="mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-(--primary)" aria-hidden="true" />
				<span>Échange confidentiel : ton message arrive directement à Cécile.</span>
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
